flowchart LR
  A[Core Contract request<br/>canonical IDs + policies] --> B[Verifier response envelopes<br/>exact DSSE payload binding]
  B --> C[Pure local Q0 aggregator<br/>sort • bind • group • threshold]
  C --> D{Decision}
  D -->|threshold_verified / failed / unverifiable| E[Quorum decision record]
  D -->|contested| F[Preserve all classes<br/>equivocation evidence]
  E --> G[Local audit adapter<br/>optional checkpoint reference]
  F --> G
  H[(Network discovery<br/>leader election<br/>replicated consensus)] -. excluded from Q0 .-> C
  I[(Physical truth<br/>GU interpretation)] -. never inferred .-> D
